## Capability

Map a discrete or continuous possessed-object input to a typed public action on a hatch or lamp. Expose ranges, units, cancel and target focus.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Invoke the same action from the inspector, a sensor, Fiote and the remapped control. Lose focus while holding the control and reopen with no held-input replay.

